the first proof-progress interfaces on the current proof surface: analytic now
constructs a scoped standard-model zero Riemann-curvature bridge and the
stationary zero Ricci-flow equation evidence, finite extinction constructs its
target sweepout payload from the target assumptions, and topology constructs
the full topology extraction package from the simply connected recognition
prefix.
-/

