identification, the scoped standard zero Riemann-curvature data, the closed
standard-model-only bridge, the standard metric generic zero-curvature export,
the standard stationary zero Ricci identification, and the standard stationary
zero Ricci-flow equation evidence. The topology conjunct records the raw
homeomorphism and full package construction.
